<h1>Your documents. Clear answers.</h1>
<p>AgentRAG helps you find information in documents you have added to your knowledge base. Search relevant passages and ask questions with document-title citations.</p>
<p>The AgentRAG plugin connects ChatGPT and Codex to your account through OAuth. Its tools list documents, search passages and answer questions. They access only the authenticated user's knowledge base and perform read-only operations. Uploads and document management are available in the AgentRAG website.</p>
<p>Answers are generated by an AI model and may be incomplete or inaccurate. Read the cited sources before relying on an answer.</p>
<p>Published and operated by <strong>Mathieu MOUBRI</strong>. AgentRAG does not offer purchases or process payments.</p>
